WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Welcome to our training on how to earn a brand referral bonus.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.125
Are you a brand owner selling in the U.

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:06.417
S.

00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:07.000
Amazon Store?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.652
With the brand referral bonus program, you can earn a bonus averaging 10% of product sales driven

00:00:13.652 --> 00:00:16.000
by your non-Amazon marketing efforts.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.100
That means the more traffic you drive to your Amazon listings, the more opportunities you have to

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.000
earn a bonus.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Today we'll cover how this program works, as well as the two-part process to enroll.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.913
When you direct traffic to your Amazon listings from your non-Amazon marketing, you can earn an

00:00:32.913 --> 00:00:35.000
average 10% bonus from qualifying sales.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.263
The exact bonus percentage varies by product category and is provided as a credit on your seller

00:00:41.263 --> 00:00:42.000
referral fees.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.913
You'll also earn the same bonus if a customer purchases additional products from your brand up to

00:00:47.913 --> 00:00:50.000
two weeks after clicking your ad.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.625
All brand owners selling in Amazon's U.

00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:53.000
S.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Store are eligible to enroll, and you can get started by following this two-part process.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.000
First, you'll need to enroll in the brand referral bonus program.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.000
To do this, sign in to Seller Central.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.000
From the pop-out menu, hover over Brands and select Brand Referral Bonus.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:17.000
On the Brand Referral Bonus page, you can enroll with one click if your brand is eligible.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Once enrolled, you'll be prompted to fill out the tax form required to receive your bonus.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:27.647
Once you've enrolled in the program, you're ready to create tags for your campaigns with Amazon

00:01:27.647 --> 00:01:28.000
attribution.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:35.273
Amazon attribution is a free tool that measures how your non-Amazon digital marketing impacts your

00:01:35.273 --> 00:01:38.000
sales activity in the Amazon Store.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:43.368
To earn your bonus, all of your off Amazon marketing must have an Amazon attribution tag applied

00:01:43.368 --> 00:01:44.000
to it.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:51.174
To create and generate your tags, access Amazon attribution directly on the Brand Referral Bonus

00:01:51.174 --> 00:01:55.000
page, or through your Amazon Advertising Console account.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:59.000
On the Amazon attribution dashboard, select Create Campaign.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:05.000
On the new Amazon attribution campaign page, you'll see two options for creating a campaign.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:12.111
Select the bulk upload method for Google Search and Facebook campaigns to easily tag and measure

00:02:12.111 --> 00:02:17.000
Google Search keywords or Facebook ads by uploading a single file.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:23.400
Or select Create Manually, where you'll be prompted to set up campaign structure and provide campaign

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.000
details to generate tags.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:31.300
Next, provide a name for your campaign and select the products you'll be promoting as well as any

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:32.000
associated variations.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:38.611
Once you've selected your products, you'll create an ad group for each of your off Amazon marketing

00:02:38.611 --> 00:02:39.000
strategies.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:45.000
For each group, enter a name based on the strategy or tactic for the relevant tag.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.000
Next, select the Publisher and Channel corresponding to the campaign you're measuring.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:55.913
Then, provide the click-through URL to your Amazon Store or Product Detail page you'll drive customers

00:02:55.913 --> 00:02:58.000
to when they click your ad.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:05.158
Once complete, select Create to generate an attribution tag for each ad group shown in the attribution

00:03:05.158 --> 00:03:06.000
tag column.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:11.000
You can download all tags in a file or copy each tag individually.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:15.000
Finally, implement these tags in your off Amazon campaigns.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:22.158
To do this, copy and paste the tags into the corresponding destination URL field within your non-

00:03:22.158 --> 00:03:23.000
Amazon campaign.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:29.000
For example, if you're running an ad on social media, visit the ad manager within that platform.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:34.000
You'll then copy and paste each tag into the destination URL field.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:39.000
Each Publisher system is different, so this process may vary slightly.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:44.667
As your campaigns drive sales, you'll begin earning your bonus, which is provided as a credit towards

00:03:44.667 --> 00:03:46.000
your seller referral fees.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:53.273
The bonus applies to brand-owned products with an Amazon attribution tag and customer purchase resulting

00:03:53.273 --> 00:03:56.000
from a non-Amazon marketing effort.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:03.158
Bonuses vary by product category and are subject to a two-month wait to accommodate any cancellations

00:04:03.158 --> 00:04:04.000
and returns.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:09.000
You can download your weekly bonus report on the brand referral bonus page in Seller Central.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:15.000
This report is updated every Friday with your estimated bonus amount earned up to the previous week.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:21.000
For more information on this program, search for brand referral bonus in Seller Central.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:27.562
For more information on Amazon attribution, review the Help Center content within the Amazon Advertising

00:04:27.562 --> 00:04:28.000
Console.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:32.000
This concludes our training on how to earn a brand referral bonus.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:38.000
You now have the tools to drive traffic to your Amazon listings and start earning your bonus.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:42.000
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store!
